description: "\"guarantees[5]: Universal Representation,Graph Native Identity,Consistent Metadata,Deterministic Lifecycle,Unlimited Extensibility\""
spec:
  id: entity_model
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Ontology
  compiler_stage: Knowledge Representation
  description: "\"\\\"Defines the Universal Entity Model (UEM) used throughout the TOON Dataset Compiler. Every object inside the Engineering Universe is represented as an Entity with a shared identity, lifecycle, metadata, relationships and behavioral semantics.\\\"\""
purpose: Provide one universal representation for every engineering object inside TOON.
graph: "\"\\\"Every entity has\\\"[5]: unique identity,explicit type,metadata,relationships,lifecycle\""
examples:
  Example_01:
    Entity: Repository
    Contains: Modules
  Example_02:
    Entity: Pull Request
    References: Commits
  Example_03:
    Entity: Incident
    Affects: Service
  Example_04:
    Entity: Knowledge Atom
    Enables: Capability
success: Every engineering object is represented using one universal entity model.
future:
  entity_inheritance: true
  entity_templates: true
  distributed_entities: true
  semantic_entities: true
  autonomous_entities: true
